{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"510227","name":"绮良良【彩蛋】","desc":"绮良良彩蛋","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/24077343/5b8e5120f1d0c34bdb8100f51ed88e59_920572431099768653.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基本信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e绮良良\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色名\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e1月22日\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"生日\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e狛荷屋\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"所属\"}],\"extra_attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e稻妻快递公司「拍荷屋」的送货员，一只热爱自己工作、向往人类社会的「猫又」。\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色介绍\"}],\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/24077343/3d3c77af378ae13a284da6ee46e7c8a5_1585227750533402306.png\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"8151","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/10/24077343/36dade138ea019e62ead829717e9587d_3604196141101753289.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8155","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8174","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8175","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"awrww79aqfrT1757446626367\",\"child_ids\":{\"awrww79aqfrT1757446626367\":[]},\"contents\":{\"73k3crrqm8T1762843639643\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：有什么试吃活动吗？\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"awrww79aqfrT1757446626367\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"m3jxly7nmpT1762843831876\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：果然是「猫舌头」啊…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e香菱：哎呀，你别勉强了，快快快，含着这团饭，我爹说这样解辣。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e绮良良：呜…呜喵…确实豪一点了…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e香菱：我想想喔，有什么好吃的凉菜呢…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e绮良良：咦，这饭团的味道也好好喔，和奶奶做的饭团一样好吃，酸酸甜甜的…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e香菱：那当然啦，我在里面加了煮熟的土豆和甜甜花，还有梅子干啦，树莓干啦…欸？你怎么吃掉啦！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e绮良良：舌头！舌头又烧起来了！辣辣辣辣辣辣辣！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e香菱：只有含着才有解辣的效果啦！快快快再含一团，这次别再吃啦！\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"nfmuzpieo3iT1762843640596\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：遇到什么麻烦了吗？\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"qfuinzzs3snT1762843773967\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：还是烫？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e绮良良：好辣！\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"z5bq6o55fxT1762843641613\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e香菱：旅行者，你也来了！绮良良刚从稻妻送了一批新鲜的鱼过来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e香菱：我想着她跑了这么远，就打算做点热腾腾的璃月菜招待她，所谓「一烫抵三鲜」嘛。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e绮良良：豪…豪醋！真的豪…唔喵！烫烫烫烫烫！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e香菱：真的不用勉强啦！我们璃月也有凉菜的，我马上就能做出来！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e绮良良：但这道水煮鱼真的很好吃啊！我、我再试试…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e绮良良：呼，呼呼呼呼…再拿凉水泡一泡…先泡凉…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e绮良良：唔喵！\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\"}\n","style":""}],"id":"8176","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"名称\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"上线时间\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"相关奖励\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8177","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"地图展示\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8178","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"g4jaj7d3arbT1757446626382\",\"child_ids\":{\"g4jaj7d3arbT1757446626382\":[]},\"contents\":{}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8179","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"七圣召唤对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"pkhrrroin9T1757446626402\",\"child_ids\":{\"pkhrrroin9T1757446626402\":[]},\"contents\":{}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8180","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"幻想真境剧诗对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"contents\":{},\"root_id\":\"cykiag6wq1jT1757446626408\",\"child_ids\":{\"cykiag6wq1jT1757446626408\":[]}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8181","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"生日","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"timeline_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"最棒的节日！——2024-01-22\",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e呜，最近好冷啊，晚上睡觉的时候我都不敢把尾巴伸出箱子！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e不过天一冷下来，我就知道自己的「生日」要到了！准确来说，是我从一只普通的小猫，变成妖怪的日子吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e生日这天好开心呀，「狛荷屋」的同事会送我礼物，请我吃好吃的零食，还能收获老板特批的一天带薪假！简直是人类社会最棒的纪念日！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e不过我最想做的，还是变成一只小猫回到家里，吃奶奶给我做的猫饭。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e这次你也一起来吧？只要我蹭蹭你的腿，奶奶就会知道你是我的朋友！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"768\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/10/09/8912764/2a3384590a42f858aec7f3bdc489386b_6850189712159981083.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"鸟蛋\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/768/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/768/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e鸟蛋\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2765\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/19/24077343/0f0ca5c4e6eff6c38b6199b32885ad11_183791441963685262.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"活力喵饭\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2765/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2765/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e活力喵饭\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/11/294074726/11b533d6820220222aaf668f7199e034_5452661117840249554.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/11/294074726/11b533d6820220222aaf668f7199e034_5452661117840249554.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/48228803\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e绮良良生日快乐｜怎么样怎么样，要不要猜猜里面是什么呢？\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]},{\"tab_name\":\"一起磨爪吗？——2025-01-22 \",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e哇，一觉醒来就收到了好多祝福和小鱼干！嘻嘻，不用数爪子就知道又到了我的生日啦。我把小鱼干分给了我的好喵友们，它们「喵嗷喵呜」地眨眼间就吃光了，喜欢得不得了！我还打算收集一些好看的小物什改日送件上门，给大家回礼呢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e你有兴趣出门玩吗？我们可以一边拨水玩一边采珊瑚真珠，一边爬树一边抓萤火虫…对了对了，说到爬树，我一定要带你去我最喜欢的树林,那里每一棵树的触感都很奇妙，肉垫一放上去就会不自觉磨起爪来！很放松，很「呼噜」…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e虽然人类好像不需要磨爪，但留着闻闻木头的香味也是很有意思的嘛！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2765\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/19/24077343/0f0ca5c4e6eff6c38b6199b32885ad11_183791441963685262.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"朝气盒饭\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2765/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2765/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e朝气盒饭\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2399\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/07/22/15568211/905ff94b222b5887b07bb64f58686f2a_2738820233173190494.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"孔雀木\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"10\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2399/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2399/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e孔雀木\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*10\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/11/294074726/539fb06705c6066fbef1bcfbe92ea008_4699909091170980870.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/11/294074726/539fb06705c6066fbef1bcfbe92ea008_4699909091170980870.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/61289231\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e绮良良生日快乐｜让太阳把肉垫烤的烫烫的感觉，呼呼，可舒服了！\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]},{\"tab_name\":\"厉害的大鱼——2026-01-22 \",\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e唔~！多亏了「狛荷屋」的大家提醒，我才发现我的「生日」就要到了哦！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e老板已经给我批了一个长假，只要我送完这一趟快递，我就可以开开心心地去玩啦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e虽然…那位挪德卡莱的客户说，自己在追逐霜鳍鲸…要我搭最快的船追上他们，把这一箱留影机器材送到他们手上，而且…都已经给我订好船了…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e唔喵！为什么我要去海上送快递！要是掉进海里的话…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e不行不行，为了假期…不对，为了「独荷屋」！无论客户在什么地方，快递都会准时抵达！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e话说回来，千织姐那边有没有适合在海上穿的衣服呢…？应该有吧…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e【邮件赠礼：\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2765\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2023/10/19/24077343/0f0ca5c4e6eff6c38b6199b32885ad11_183791441963685262.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"朝气盒饭\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"1\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2765/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2765/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e朝气盒饭\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*1\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"506833\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/09/75610764/0c0241b79c8ac2111d7a64fe76102037_682232013602604807.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"奶油鲑鱼汤\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"2\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/506833/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/506833/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e奶油鲑鱼汤\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"506382\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/09/01/75610764/fb8fc36f3d5aafd7d5b1141f16cd55b6_1529474239672393429.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"烟熏鱼排\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"2\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/506382/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/506382/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e烟熏鱼排\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"amount\\\"\u003e*2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e】\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdetails class=\\\"custom-details\\\"\u003e\u003csummary\u003e生日贺图\u003c/summary\u003e\u003cdiv data-type=\\\"detailsContent\\\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/10/50494840/a8a3747e8130ecf6a0a9e8a530d0788d_7356368934031361714.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"450\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/03/10/50494840/a8a3747e8130ecf6a0a9e8a530d0788d_7356368934031361714.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 450px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/72586780\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e绮良良生日快乐 | 其、其实我是在进行箱体抗压测试！\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/details\u003e\"]}]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8182","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色洞天对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"rlobens1mcaT1757446626387\",\"child_ids\":{\"2na9dnvp3c2T1757446854550\":[],\"30zrscol9giT1757446869227\":[\"uojiqa0cd0bT1757446889166\"],\"31ymo5t5kd7T1757446852314\":[\"8z2gi4w1394T1757446931470\"],\"6s2gduzqhsjT1757447020640\":[\"dsrcg6f0z2T1757447027908\",\"ygl682kzp7fT1757447048664\"],\"85c803q9deeT1757447064696\":[],\"8z2gi4w1394T1757446931470\":[\"qqz7tabzx98T1757446933493\",\"xtqte2zjf1T1757446934316\"],\"9qxy28gn687T1757446907624\":[],\"dsrcg6f0z2T1757447027908\":[],\"e54by9zq0q9T1757446977747\":[],\"fdaaadg44xqT1757446962305\":[\"e54by9zq0q9T1757446977747\"],\"j6s7gy243oT1757446908535\":[],\"jt05fc8q4f9T1757446851966\":[\"30zrscol9giT1757446869227\",\"yvnbggzcxheT1757446870016\"],\"qqz7tabzx98T1757446933493\":[\"za3egg6ovqpT1757446961517\",\"fdaaadg44xqT1757446962305\"],\"rlobens1mcaT1757446626387\":[\"jt05fc8q4f9T1757446851966\",\"31ymo5t5kd7T1757446852314\",\"t1kdsx4dy3gT1757446852667\",\"shuisufju2bT1757446852998\",\"2na9dnvp3c2T1757446854550\",\"85c803q9deeT1757447064696\"],\"shuisufju2bT1757446852998\":[\"6s2gduzqhsjT1757447020640\"],\"t1kdsx4dy3gT1757446852667\":[\"6s2gduzqhsjT1757447020640\"],\"uojiqa0cd0bT1757446889166\":[\"9qxy28gn687T1757446907624\",\"j6s7gy243oT1757446908535\"],\"xtqte2zjf1T1757446934316\":[\"e54by9zq0q9T1757446977747\"],\"ygl682kzp7fT1757447048664\":[],\"yvnbggzcxheT1757446870016\":[\"uojiqa0cd0bT1757446889166\"],\"za3egg6ovqpT1757446961517\":[\"e54by9zq0q9T1757446977747\"]},\"contents\":{\"2na9dnvp3c2T1757446854550\":{\"option\":\"【早啊，绮良良。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e早，旅行者！我今天看起来还不错吧？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你放心，这里的团雀我一只都不会碰的！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"30zrscol9giT1757446869227\":{\"option\":\"【好高的评价…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e这是你应得的，我才该多谢谢你。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"31ymo5t5kd7T1757446852314\":{\"option\":\"【想一起聊聊天吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e好呀，有什么想问我的吗？\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"6s2gduzqhsjT1757447020640\":{\"option\":\"【这个…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e太突然了吗？抱歉抱歉！那我从头讲好了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你知道，我虽然是个妖怪，但从小时候起，就一直受到人类奶奶的照顾。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e人的故事，比妖的故事，听得多的多了。温暖又多彩的人类社会，我非常向往！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e于是，我好不容易才用妖力变出了现在的外貌，可新的问题又来了。如果打扮和举止太像「猫又」，也不太好…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e所以，我偷偷观察了人类女孩子的打扮，大家似乎都很喜欢蝴蝶结和花朵…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我就给自己的衣服加了不少！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"85c803q9deeT1757447064696\":{\"option\":\"【晚安，绮良良。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e晚安。梦里要是听到嘎吱嘎吱声的话，可不要觉得奇怪。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我…我尽量不在半夜吃东西。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8z2gi4w1394T1757446931470\":{\"option\":\"【聊聊快递工作？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e噢，这个话题好！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e接单量对我来说不是难事，妖怪的腿脚天生跑得就快。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e但好评率就没那么容易维持了。怕麻烦，不想多费周折是人之常情…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e奇怪…为什么是只猫的时候，路过的人会花时间来看我晒太阳，但变成人后就没人愿意多花些时间给个好评呢？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"9qxy28gn687T1757446907624\":{\"option\":\"【那是壶灵阿圆。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e壶灵？跟付丧神类似吗？难道说她的本体是个茶壶？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e还是说…现在的样子正是她原本的形态，而她也像我一样，能变成一名少女？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哎呀，太让人好奇了！请介绍我跟她认识认识吧！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"dsrcg6f0z2T1757447027908\":{\"option\":\"【的确很可爱。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e真的吗？那太好啦。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e那个…等你什么时候有空，可以陪我逛逛商店吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我想买些好看的小饰品，有你提供意见，肯定会更顺利！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"e54by9zq0q9T1757446977747\":{\"option\":\"【听上去你很热爱工作。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e是啊。多亏了它，我才能这样融入人类的城市。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e负责一点…才能算「报恩」？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"fdaaadg44xqT1757446962305\":{\"option\":\"【三只猫又六条尾巴…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e停停停！再数下去感觉尾巴都要打结了！\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"j6s7gy243oT1757446908535\":{\"option\":\"【她可不能吃。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e啊！不会的，不会的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我只是有一点点好奇而已，想知道她是怎么来的，平时会想些什么、做点什么…说不定还能交上朋友。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e有机会的话，请介绍我跟她认识认识吧！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"jt05fc8q4f9T1757446851966\":{\"option\":\"【在这里还习惯吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e欸，那么快就到「用户回访」环节了吗？咳咳，那我可要认真作答。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e环境分，五星！这里风景优美，难能一见，好像还存在着某种我看不透的妖力…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e舒适度，五星！晚上我在箱子里睡得可安稳了！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e没有噪音，没有强光，完全可以给满分！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e最后…服务分也是五星，无可挑剔。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"qqz7tabzx98T1757446933493\":{\"option\":\"【不辛苦吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e可能会有一点吧，尤其在筹备祭典的时候，加急件总会像墩墩桃那样挤在一堆。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e真想妖力变得更强些。这样说不定能跑得更快，或者变出好多个自己。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"rlobens1mcaT1757446626387\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e旅行者！今天天气真好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e唔…仔细想想，这里的天气总是一个样呢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"shuisufju2bT1757446852998\":{\"option\":\"【有什么想做的吗？】（对荧）\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e啊，我有个事情早就想问你了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你喜欢怎样打扮自己呀？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"t1kdsx4dy3gT1757446852667\":{\"option\":\"【有什么想做的吗？】（对空）\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e啊，我有个事情早就想问你了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e你知道人类女孩子喜欢些什么打扮吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"uojiqa0cd0bT1757446889166\":{\"option\":\"【还有其他感想吗？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e噢噢，我懂，是最后的简答部分，好大一个空格子对吧！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e唔…我想想啊。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我对那只个头大大的碧团雀挺感兴趣的。看上去胖墩墩、毛茸茸的，模样很悠闲，警惕性也低…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"xtqte2zjf1T1757446934316\":{\"option\":\"【收效如何？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘿嘿，我现在是唯一一位，「狛荷屋」金牌级快递员。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e之前老板还想给我一笔特别奖励呢！但我也说了，还是公费出游…啊不，还是多给我些接跨国件的机会更好。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ygl682kzp7fT1757447048664\":{\"option\":\"【不如再搭配点别的。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哇，你很懂行呀？我果然没有问错人！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e那个…等你什么时候有空，可以陪我逛逛商店吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我想买些好看的小饰品，有你提供意见，肯定会更顺利！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"yvnbggzcxheT1757446870016\":{\"option\":\"【好认真的回答…】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e你做了那么多，有这个机会，我当然要好好表达自己的心情。\u003c/p\u003e\",\